## 2. Proposed Changes & File Updates

### Frontend (`sapar-typescript-frontend`)
1. **[NEW]** `src/pages/admin/accounting/ContrasList.tsx`: Contras index page with filtering, status, and actions.
2. **[NEW]** `src/pages/admin/accounting/CreateContra.tsx`: Interactive Contra creation wizard matching customer invoices to vendor bills.
3. **[NEW]** `src/pages/admin/accounting/AllReportsHub.tsx`: Bukku-styled comprehensive reports catalog organized by category.
4. **[MODIFY]** `src/pages/admin/accounting/ChartOfAccountsList.tsx`: Enhance with classification tabs (Assets, Liabilities, Equity, Income, Expenses), sub-account tree, system badges, and quick ledger navigation.
5. **[MODIFY]** `src/pages/admin/accounting/CreateJournalEntry.tsx` & `JournalEntryList.tsx`: Add Storno reverse entry, currency conversion, contact tagging, and balancing helper.
6. **[MODIFY]** `src/pages/admin/accounting/FixedAssets.tsx`: Enhance asset registration modal, monthly depreciation runner with journal generation, and disposal schedule.
7. **[MODIFY]** `src/pages/admin/finance-and-accounting/Banking.tsx` & `ReconciliationList.tsx`: Polished bank accounts view, Money In / Money Out tabs, and reconciliation UI.
8. **[MODIFY]** `src/routes/AdminRoute.tsx` & `Sidebar.tsx`: Wire all routes, submenus, and quick action shortcuts.

### Backend (`sapar-backend`)
1. **[MODIFY/NEW]** Contras controller & service: endpoints for calculating unallocated invoices/bills, creating offsetting journal entries, and generating reconciliation act.
2. **[MODIFY]** Fixed assets service: automated depreciation run endpoint creating journal entries for specified accounting period.
3. **[MODIFY]** Banking & Bank feed reconciler: streamline bank transaction reconciliation.

